<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net"><diagram name="정리 추천 폴딩" id="d1"><mxGraphModel dx="1140" dy="640" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1140" pageHeight="640" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c2" value="정리 후보 목록&lt;br&gt;(파일 + 폴더, 최대 5,000건)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="30" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="① 부모 폴더별로 묶기&lt;br&gt;(드라이브 → 폴더 체인)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="130" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="② (a) 같은 폴더 패턴&lt;br&gt;숫자·날짜·해시만 다른 이름&lt;br&gt;같은 키 5건 이상 → 접기" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="230" width="180" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="③ (b) 여러 폴더 같은 이름&lt;br&gt;남은 후보 중 같은 키 5건 이상&lt;br&gt;+ 폴더 2곳 이상 + 같은 드라이브&lt;br&gt;→ 공통 상위 폴더 아래로" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="350" width="180" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="④ 한 갈래 폴더 체인 합치기&lt;br&gt;C:\Users\me\AppData" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="480" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="⑤ 크기·등급·체크 집계 → 정렬" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="570" width="180" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;jettySize=auto;orthogonalLoop=1;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=11;endArrow=block;endFill=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c2" target="c3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;jettySize=auto;orthogonalLoop=1;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=11;endArrow=block;endFill=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c3" target="c4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;jettySize=auto;orthogonalLoop=1;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=11;endArrow=block;endFill=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;jettySize=auto;orthogonalLoop=1;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=11;endArrow=block;endFill=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c5" target="c6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c12" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;jettySize=auto;orthogonalLoop=1;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=11;endArrow=block;endFill=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c6" target="c7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c13" value="패턴 키 만들기 (PatternKey)" style="swimlane;startSize=28;html=1;rounded=1;arcSize=4;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;horizontal=1;collapsible=0;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="240" y="30" width="330" height="260" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c14" value="1. 확장자 분리 (폴더 이름은 분리 안 함)&lt;br&gt;2. GUID → #&lt;br&gt;3. 숫자·영문 섞인 8자↑ 16진 토큰 → #&lt;br&gt;4. 나머지 숫자 → #&lt;br&gt;5. 구분자로 이어진 #  →  # 하나&lt;br&gt;6. 소문자로 통일&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;log_20240101.txt&lt;/b&gt; → log_#.txt&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;dump (3).dmp&lt;/b&gt; → dump (#).dmp&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;cache_3fa9c21b7d.dat&lt;/b&gt; → cache_#.dat&lt;br&gt;.mp3 / .mp4 는 서로 다른 패턴&lt;br&gt;backup.7z.001 → backup.7z.#" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=11;fontColor=#333333;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="c13"><mxGeometry x="15" y="38" width="300" height="210" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c15" value="결과: 폴더 트리 (□ 3단계 체크박스)" style="swimlane;startSize=28;html=1;rounded=1;arcSize=4;fillColor=#d0f0ee;strokeColor=#3a9d96;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;horizontal=1;collapsible=0;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="610" y="30" width="510" height="590" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c16" value="☑ C:\Users\me\...\demo" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="c15"><mxGeometry x="15" y="44" width="360" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c17" value="7.96 GB · 34건" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=10;fontColor=#666666;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="c15"><mxGeometry x="390" y="51" width="110" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c18" value="▣ Downloads" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="c15"><mxGeometry x="49" y="86" width="326" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c19" value="3.17 GB · 25건" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=10;fontColor=#666666;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="c15"><mxGeometry x="390" y="93" width="110" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c20" value="☑